        "{\"a2uiMeta\":{\"note\":\"The pool and gym are open from 06:00 to 22:00. The spa is open from 09:00 to 20:00. In season, please book spa treatments at least a day ahead.\",\"trace\":{\"turnIndex\":0,\"query\":{\"intent\":\"## Referenced for this message\\n### property-knowledge-base (resource)\\nAccessibility, policy, group-booking, and wedding facts the concierge cites.\\n\\nStep-free throughout — ramped entrance, lifts to every floor, four ADA rooms with roll-in showers and a portable hoist on request. Check-in 15:00, check-out 11:00; late check-out to 14:00 subject to availability. Cancellations are free up to 48h before arrival, one night’s rate after. Groups of 10+ rooms get a dedicated coordinator and a 10% rate; the event spaces seat 120 banquet-style or 200 standing. Weddings run three packages — Intimate, Classic, Grand — covering the ballroom or the waterfront terrace, in-house catering from Vela’s kitchen, and a preferred-vendor list for florists and photographers; quote a package, never a firm price, without confirming the date with the events team. Pool (25m, heated) and gym open 06:00–22:00; spa 09:00–20:00 — book treatments at least a day ahead in season.\\n\\nWhat are the opening hours of the pool, gym and spa? Check the property-knowledge-base.\",\"k\":3},\"exemplarIds\":[\"domain-hospitality-itinerary-trip\",\"domain-concierge-booking-request\",\"frontier-service-gateway\"],\"rounds\":1,\"healed\":0,\"failureCodes\":[],\"model\":\"claude-haiku-5-5\",\"prompt\":{\"limit\":150200,\"total\":62155,\"sections\":[{\"id\":\"grammar\",\"chars\":27654},{\"id\":\"components\",\"chars\":22864},{\"id\":\"functions\",\"chars\":145},{\"id\":\"few-shot\",\"chars\":3953},{\"id\":\"mini-skills\",\"chars\":2193},{\"id\":\"persona\",\"chars\":5346}],\"over\":false},\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":4874,\"outputTokens\":1067,\"cacheReadInputTokens\":19339,\"cacheCreationInputTokens\":0},\"miniSkillIds\":[\"greeting-card\",\"nested-record-editor\",\"feature-collecti